+public record DiscardedPayload(Identifier id, byte[] data) implements CustomPacketPayload {
+    /**
+     * The unnamed-body form, which is what every existing call site constructs.
+     *
+     * <p>Kept because the record gained a component: code that only wants to describe an unknown
+     * channel must keep compiling and keep meaning "a payload with no body".
